        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Specified Requirements&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;For the interview on Tuesday the 2nd, please be prepared to present an architecture diagram for a web based tool that will help non-technical user solve Wordle puzzles. Describe the technology stack you would recommend for this solution and propose the high level logic steps. &lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The solution should:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Allow the user to make the initial guess via a web interface&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sugget a reasonable next guess&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Track the users scores over time when they use this tool.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Not rely on existing Wordle solutions such as&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;https://pypi.org/project/wordle-autosolver/&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="Product Requirements&#xa;For the interview on Tuesday the 2nd, please be prepared to present an architecture diagram for a web based tool that will help non-technical user solve Wordle puzzles. Describe the technology stack you would recommend for this solution and propose the high level logic steps. &#xa;The solution should:&#xa;Allow the user to make the initial guess via a web interface &#xa;Suggest a reasonable next guess &#xa;Track the users scores over time when they use this tool. &#xa;Not rely on existing Wordle solutions such as&#xa;https://pypi.org/project/wordle-autosolver/&#xa;&#xa;Design Guidelines&#xa;Minimize user input&#xa;Keep it Super Simple (KISS)&#xa;Event Driven&#xa;Serverless&#xa;Cloud Native&#xa;Stateless Frontend&#xa;Stateful Database&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Tech Stack:&#xa;Web Interface:  React Framework running on AWS ECS&#xa;Backend API Layer: AWS API Gateway with multiple routes&#xa;Core Processing Logic: Python executed by Lambda functions, trigger by Events&#xa;Database: Amazon RDS, Postgres&#xa;Identity Provider: Cognito" id="H_-AP8sSiu5K2X2Lht5T-2">
          <mxCell style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
